  "title": "Pre-Vote round started while Candidate survives leader establishment and makes the new leader re-elect",
  "cause": "establish_leader/become_leader do not reset Engine.pre_candidate, and handle_pre_vote_resp calls elect() on a Pre-Vote quorum without checking that the node is still the non-leader whose vote the round probed; a Candidate can start such a round because the tick skips only Leaders and Trigger::elect(true) has no role check.",
  "trigger": "A Candidate at term T starts a Pre-Vote round (election timer or Trigger::elect(true)) while its real vote replies are in flight; a peer grants both the real vote and the term T+1 Pre-Vote (its uncommitted vote carries no lease); the real grant arrives first and the node becomes Leader at T; the Pre-Vote grant is delivered afterwards, within the RPC timeout.",
  "consequence": "The freshly established Leader abandons term T and starts an election at T+1 that peers holding its lease reject, leaving the cluster without a working leader for at least a lease and inflating the term (the disruption Pre-Vote is documented to prevent); with debug assertions the stale Leader object trips Engine::try_leader_handler and RaftCore panics.",
  "sites": [
    "openraft/src/engine/engine_impl.rs:establish_leader",
    "openraft/src/engine/engine_impl.rs:handle_pre_vote_resp",
    "openraft/src/engine/engine_impl.rs:pre_elect",
    "openraft/src/engine/handler/vote_handler/mod.rs:become_leader",
    "openraft/src/core/raft_core.rs:handle_tick_election"
  ],
  "actions": [
    "PreElect",
    "TickPreElect",
    "ExternalPreElect",
    "HandleVoteResponse",
    "HandlePreVoteResponseElect",
    "DoElect"
  ],
  "invariants": [
    "PreVoteElectionPremiseCurrent",
    "PreVoteNeverDisplacesLeader",
    "EstablishedLeaderHasNoInheritedPreVote"
  ],
  "premises": [
    "A node can start a Pre-Vote round while it is a Candidate: handle_tick_election skips only ServerState::Leader and ExternalCommand::Elect{pre_vote:true} checks only voter membership.",
    "Leader establishment (establish_leader -> update_vote -> become_leader) does not reset Engine.pre_candidate; only do_elect and become_following do.",
    "A peer that granted the real vote holds an uncommitted vote without leader lease and therefore grants the term+1 Pre-Vote.",
    "Message delay may deliver the Pre-Vote grant after the real-vote grant within the vote RPC timeout (election_timeout_min).",
    "Pre-Vote is enabled (Config::enable_pre_vote / runtime toggle) or requested per call with Trigger::elect(true)."
  ],
